WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hey, I'm Hani. When our brains get worried, they run off to yesterday or tomorrow. This game brings your brain back to right here, right now, using your five senses. Ready?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Hani

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:22.000
First, look around the room. Find five things you can see. Count them quietly in your head. A door. A light. A shoe. Anything.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Look around. Find 5 things you can SEE.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.667
Now find four things you can feel. Maybe your chair holding you up. Your shirt on your shoulders. The floor under your feet. The air on your face.

00:00:52.667 --> 00:01:10.000
Find 4 things you can FEEL.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:17.917
Now listen. Find three things you can hear. Close sounds, and far away sounds. Even quiet has a sound.

00:01:17.917 --> 00:01:37.000
Find 3 things you can HEAR.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:45.750
Find two things you can smell. And if you can't smell anything right now, just think of two smells you love.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:02:00.000
Find 2 things you can SMELL.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:07.500
And think of one taste you remember, or one you can imagine right now, like your favorite food.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:20.000
Think of 1 taste you remember.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:27.917
Now notice: your whole brain is right here, right now, in this room. Not in yesterday. Not in tomorrow.

00:02:27.917 --> 00:02:43.000
Notice where you are.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:49.667
Take one slow breath. You just brought yourself all the way back. That's a real skill.

00:02:49.667 --> 00:03:03.000
One slow breath.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:11.000
That's five, four, three, two, one. Your senses are always with you, so this tool is always with you too.
